  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 79 by 40 (the tens digit of 48, which is 4 times 10):\n```\n   79\nx 40\n------\n 3160\n```\nWe add these two results together:\n```\n   79\nx 48\n------\n 632\n+3160\n------\n 3722\n```\nSo, the product of 79 and 48 is 3722.\n</\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>\n</answer>",
