messages:  ['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 54 and 10? Please reason step by step.I think the correct answer is: 840\n\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 54 and 10, we can follow these steps:\n1. Understand that the product of two numbers is the result of multiplying them together.\n2. Recognize that multiplying by 10 is equivalent to adding a zero to the end of the number.\n3. Apply this rule to the number 54.\n4. Since 54 is the number we are multiplying, we can simply add a zero to the end of 54 to find the product.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe product of 54 and 10 is 540. This is because when you multiply any number by 10, you add a zero to the end of that number. In this case, adding a zero to 54 gives us 540.\n</answer>\n']
