messages:  ['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 30 and 42? Please reason step by step.I think the correct answer is: 5260\n\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 30 and 42, we can follow these steps:\n1. Understand that the product of two numbers is the result of multiplying them together.\n2. Recognize that 30 and 42 are both multiples of 10 and 6, respectively.\n3. Break down the numbers to make the multiplication easier:\n   - 30 can be written as 3 × 10\n   - 42 can be written as 6 × 7\n4. Now, we can rewrite the multiplication as:\n   (3 × 10) × (6 × 7)\n5. According to the associative property of multiplication, we can rearrange the factors:\n   3 × 6 × 10 × 7\n6. Calculate the products step by step:\n   - First, multiply 3 and 6: 3 × 6 = 18\n   - Then, multiply 10 and 7: 10 × 7 = 70\n   - Finally, multiply the results of the previous steps: 18 × 70\n7. To make the multiplication of 18 and 70 easier, we can break it down further:\n   - 18 × 70 = 18 × (7 × 10) = (18 × 7) × 10\n   - Calculate 18 × 7: 18 × 7 = 126\n   -\n']
